description: "Prose Primer, a Mac app in progress, teaches grammar's vocabulary on the text you're actually reading and writing."
lede: "Most people who write a lot never learned grammar’s vocabulary. They can feel that a sentence is clunky, but can’t say why. Prose Primer teaches that vocabulary on the text you’re actually reading or writing."
stateNote: "Not released yet. When it is, the download will be right here."
privacyLine: "Your writing stays on your Mac, and most of the analysis happens there too. The policy will be final before release."
