  <div class="prose-copy">
    <p class="wall-copy">It’s a learning tool <em>(what is a gerund?)</em>, an exploration tool <em>(what’s going on in this paragraph?)</em>, and a writing tool <em>(how could this sentence be built differently?)</em>.</p>
    <p class="wall-copy soft">It succeeds when a writer can name what’s happening in a sentence they wrote, and then decide whether to keep it.</p>
